  "title": "Cluster Traces",
  "uid": "cluster-traces",
  "description": "Request rate, latency and error rate per service, derived from OpenTelemetry span metrics. Requires Tempo with its span-metrics generator writing traces_spanmetrics_* into Prometheus, plus a Tempo datasource for the Service variable. Ships only when the monitoring chart is told a trace backend exists (dashboards.backends.traces, which defaults to k8s-monitoring.enabled).",
